  <Text in="@shipComing" text="Transport Ship Approaching
from arrow direction
Get on Board when it lands" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@start" wait="48" text="Head for the main headquarters." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@start" wait="96" text="Once inside, go up the elevator to the 
briefing room." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" text="Welcome." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="24" text="1/13
We are now at war with the RHC -- 
the Red HECTOR Clan." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="400" text="3/13
You must destroy their guards and use 
their passes to gain initial entry." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="600" text="4/13
Once inside you must kill higher 
ranking RHC to get more security 
clearance." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="200" text="2/13
Your mission is to shut down their 
force field for a bombing run." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="800" text="5/13
Once you have a Level 3 pass, 
you need to find the shield generator building." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1000" text="6/13
Figure out how to disable it before you
are killed." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1200" text="7/13
Once it is disabled the bombing
raid will start shortly." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1400" text="8/13
Needless to say -- get back on 
the transport as fast as you can." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1600" text="9/13
You will be rewarded quite 
well if you return with a job
well done." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1800" text="10/13
The hologram here displays a
layout of the enemy fortress." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" cx="171.73611111111111" cz="118.88888888888889" r="1.6666666666666643" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="2000" text="11/13
The drop zone, entrance, and 
approximate generator location
